<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUBOR rates drop for all maturities.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUBOR rates drop for all maturities.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) fell on Wednesday for all maturities the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.51 percent, down 0.1, the three-month rate at 20.09 percent, down 0.11, and the six-month rate at 19.74, down 0.04.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
